flow main() {
  How shall we travel?
  {?
    + [Eat another donut] {
        You eat another donut. -> main
      }
    * [Get off the couch] {
        You struggle up off the couch to go and compose epic poetry.
        -> END
      }
  }
  {?
    * "I am somewhat tired[."]," I repeated. {
        "Really," he responded. "How deleterious."
      }
    * "Nothing, Monsieur!"[] I replied. {
        "Very good, then."
      }
  }
}
